Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.54,0:00:08.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look! I drew you, Aria!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.13,0:00:10.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't want me!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.63,0:00:11.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Draw Meria instead!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.08,0:00:14.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aww, but I worked hard on that...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.50,0:00:21.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You know she'd much rather get a picture of\Nher favorite character from your manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.25,0:00:24.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's VB's biggest fan, after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.17,0:00:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mami!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.71,0:00:27.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've still got lots of copies left.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.67,0:00:29.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go sign a few more for her.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.13,0:00:31.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why bother?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.63,0:00:33.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It got canceled because\Nno one was reading it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.08,0:00:37.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you think she cares about that? Hmm?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.75,0:00:39.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's so cool!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.08,0:00:44.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I loved my dad and his manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.58,0:00:46.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.58,0:00:50.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,When are you actually going\Nto get published again?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.08,0:00:54.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've told me a thousand times\N"this next meeting is the one!"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.71,0:00:56.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But it's a year later,\Nand we're still here!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.54,0:01:00.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That last one got shot down.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.79,0:01:03.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm working on something new now.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:04.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.79,0:01:06.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you bother telling me that?!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.83,0:01:09.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't have meant anything to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It means something when I'm paying the bills!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.08,0:01:19.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Long story short,\Nhe just couldn't get published again,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.46,0:01:21.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,and they got divorced when I was six.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.75,0:01:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get why my mom left him.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.83,0:01:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,The last thing I remember about\Nmy dad was his obsession with work.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.25,0:01:36.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, I'm not bothered they got divorced.\NMom and Dad had their reasons.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.00,0:01:40.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,What bothers me is the last\Nwords we said to each other...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.63,0:01:43.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,...were said in anger.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.08,0:01:47.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are you reading my manga?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.67,0:01:49.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't you know it's horrible?!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.83,0:01:51.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.63,0:01:53.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't get it, Aria.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.38,0:01:58.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone says this manga is trash.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.83,0:02:03.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone pointed and\Nlaughed at how awful it was!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.46,0:02:06.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,How no one should ever bother with it!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.83,0:02:08.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone said it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.96,0:02:13.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,The editorial team agreed...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.75,0:02:15.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was that.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.21,0:02:19.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,This book is the proof I'm a hack job manga-ka!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.38,0:02:21.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,This stupid book is the reason...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.63,0:02:24.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,...that my career is dead!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.00,0:02:32.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.71,0:02:36.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hate you, and I hate your stupid manga!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.50,0:02:47.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have known that was\Nthe day my dad was leaving us.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.50,0:04:30.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's been ten years since he left.\NMom says she doesn't know what he's up to.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.25,0:04:33.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Though I can bet he probably quit working on manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.04,0:04:41.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I would've never guessed Aria's dad was\Nthe creator of Valkyrie Battle, Yo Kisaki...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.21,0:04:44.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to apologize for what I said.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.38,0:04:47.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I want him to apologize, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.54,0:04:51.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you're doing this to find Kisaki-sensei...\NI mean, your dad?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.96,0:04:55.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have no idea where he is or what he's up to.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.08,0:05:01.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,So if I got famous, he'd see me,\Nbut my dad doesn't watch TV or read magazines.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.00,0:05:04.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, if I wore a cosplay from\Na manga he created,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.71,0:05:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,he'd have to hear about me!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.92,0:05:12.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought about hiring a private investigator,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.00,0:05:14.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I wasn't sure what\NI'd do when I found him.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.63,0:05:17.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like having that talk with him right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.88,0:05:25.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But there's one thing I want to tell him,\Nmore than anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.96,0:05:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to tell the creator of Valkyrie Battle\Nhow much I really love his manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.54,0:05:39.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because I'm not just his daughter.\NI'm a reader and a fan of his manga.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.21,0:05:43.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You want to show the creator\Nhow much you love his work?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.71,0:05:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never needed to teach\Nyou anything about cosplay.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.58,0:05:53.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You already know what cosplay is!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.92,0:05:55.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.50,0:06:00.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing to teach you, Aria-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.04,0:06:04.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll help!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.29,0:06:08.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You want to get super famous, right?!\NWe can help!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.67,0:06:09.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nono-pi...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.71,0:06:16.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,First you have to get famous,\Nthen you can do a VB cosplay, yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.33,0:06:18.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,What event should we target?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.08,0:06:22.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,If we're doing Ariel,\Nmaybe we should aim for July?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.21,0:06:23.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,August?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.75,0:06:27.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please! We've gotta do it for Summer Comiket!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.46,0:06:31.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Summer Comiket?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.58,0:06:37.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, everyone's kinda freaking out...\NIs that a big deal?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.75,0:06:39.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You haven't heard of Summer Comiket?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.50,0:06:43.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's the biggest event of the year!\NSeven hundred thousand people go there!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.46,0:06:45.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seven hundred thousand?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.54,0:06:47.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.50,0:06:53.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I post that Liliel and I are doing\Nthe Angelic Airborne Defense Squadron...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.00,0:06:55.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait a second...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.33,0:06:58.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're gonna need one more person!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.83,0:07:01.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone will think we'll be a group of four!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.46,0:07:03.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, the girl with the black hair.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.29,0:07:06.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,The one who kinda came out of nowhere, honestly...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.13,0:07:10.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It seems like that in the spinoff!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.25,0:07:13.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's actually a super popular\Ncharacter from the original!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.54,0:07:16.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should we start looking for our fourth?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.63,0:07:23.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,So actually, I had this thought when\Nwe were discussing plans earlier.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.13,0:07:25.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,She should be coming today, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.75,0:07:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.50,0:07:30.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.00,0:07:33.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess whose modeling work's\Ngoing on hiatus for a little bit?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.13,0:07:34.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, who are all these other girls?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.29,0:07:36.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,M-M-Mi...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.63,0:07:38.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.92,0:07:41.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why do I have a bad feeling about this?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.96,0:07:42.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikarin?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.79,0:07:44.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You wanna introduce yourself?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.04,0:07:46.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ohmigod, I'm such a huge fan!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.21,0:07:48.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're a fan?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.58,0:07:52.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm Aria! I follow your Insta,\Nand I always read your interviews!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.46,0:07:57.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, Mikari, you really are famous.\NThis is so cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.13,0:08:00.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Aria-chan.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.96,0:08:03.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Want an autograph?\NThanks for all the support.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.83,0:08:06.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ohmigod, you're gorgeous...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.88,0:08:08.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.08,0:08:10.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,So... Who is she?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.63,0:08:13.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't know Mikarin?! She's a huge model!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.17,0:08:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Weren't you the one who told me\Nto be a model to get famous?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.63,0:08:23.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,So... Maybe your original plan was the right choice.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.63,0:08:28.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, I understand what's up now.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.71,0:08:31.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura and Mikarin were\Nfriends when they were kids?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.79,0:08:35.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you need me to be your fourth member.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.13,0:08:39.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, but even if you're friends with Ririsa,\Nthere's no way you'd actually do it, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.75,0:08:43.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,If Senpai asked, I'd at least think it over.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.04,0:08:43.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.75,0:08:46.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way?! You'd do it for HIM?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.17,0:08:49.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, how is he standing in the same room\Nas Mikarin and not freaking out?!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.29,0:08:55.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.96,0:08:59.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,D'ya wanna see me cosplay?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.96,0:09:04.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get to see all four members of the squad together?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.88,0:09:05.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.96,0:09:08.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're that obsessed with anime girls?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.71,0:09:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then I'm in!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.63,0:09:10.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikarin?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.96,0:09:13.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is good and all,\Nbut are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.75,0:09:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fashion models don't usually go to Comiket...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.75,0:09:21.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mikarin said in an interview that\Ncosplay is one of her hobbies!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.13,0:09:21.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.33,0:09:25.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's been posting cosplay pics to her Insta, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.46,0:09:29.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yep! My agency said it's cool for me to cosplay.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.21,0:09:30.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.08,0:09:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.21,0:09:36.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you like to do on your days off?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.00,0:09:37.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love to cosplay!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.79,0:09:40.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay? Wow.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.88,0:09:42.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,For two months,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.50,0:09:46.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've put everything I have into making\Nit normal for models to cosplay!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.21,0:09:50.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now, it'll be a cinch for me to wear a costume,\Nand I'm doing it all for one special person...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.38,0:09:53.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you do that for me?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.25,0:09:55.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Girl, no.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.04,0:10:00.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anyways, I'll wear whatever Senpai wants,\Njust say the word.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.29,0:10:03.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,We could book a private studio\Nand take some raunchy pics, too...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.08,0:10:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'd do that? Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.67,0:10:09.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, does Mikarin have a thing for Okumura?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.00,0:10:11.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way, that'd be crazy.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.38,0:10:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look how close they are after\Nso many years of friendship...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.04,0:10:16.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's so cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.50,0:10:18.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, then!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.58,0:10:21.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's get started on making the\Ncostumes for Ariel and Miriela!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.71,0:10:22.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.75,0:10:25.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I bought the materials you asked for.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.88,0:10:27.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you need any for Miriela?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.46,0:10:29.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I already got them, boss!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.58,0:10:33.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, could you get out the pattern paper?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.33,0:10:36.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna start with teaching\Nyou how to make your own pattern!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.04,0:10:38.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.08,0:10:41.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're gonna sew, too?\NJust let Ririsa do everything.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.25,0:10:45.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way!\NMaking it by hand will really show my love!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.63,0:10:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why I make all my Valentine's\Nchocolate and write physical letters, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.50,0:10:54.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, did Senpai not realize I loved him because\NI always gave him super-expensive chocolate?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.75,0:10:58.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,This cost me ten thousand yen from a fancy hotel.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.08,0:10:58.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.58,0:11:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, that wasn't the problem.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.63,0:11:10.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I can solve it by doing this next year.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.88,0:11:13.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,This cost me ten thousand yen from a fancy hotel.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.71,0:11:22.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I followed your instructions\Nand got my measurements.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.79,0:11:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you not gonna do mine?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.71,0:11:28.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nope! I remember all of yours from last time!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.96,0:11:32.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, but like, that was back in May.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.63,0:11:36.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I could've grown a little since then!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.50,0:11:40.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I do all my exercises every day,\Nand I've been taking supplements!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.46,0:11:42.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,In just two months, though?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.46,0:11:50.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,See? Same numbers as before!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.71,0:11:52.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll start on your pattern!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.71,0:11:52.17,Q5,,0,0,0,,But I did the exercises... Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.17,0:11:52.92,Q6,,0,0,0,,But I did the exercises... Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.92,0:11:54.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it's okay...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.00,0:11:56.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I feel like we're bonding.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.33,0:12:01.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,A pattern is made up of each piece of\Nfabric we're going to cut and sew.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.79,0:12:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll determine the shapes of all the\Npieces and how they'll get sewn together.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.38,0:12:11.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,None of these instructions are in the manga,\Nso we have to figure it out on our own.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.04,0:12:19.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Taking the 2D design and recreating it in\N3D is where a cosplayer's skill can really shine!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.67,0:12:27.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,We can use most of Liliel's pattern to make Ariel,\Nso just follow along with me!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.21,0:12:30.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is Version 4.6.2!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.33,0:12:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I added darts to the bust so you\Ndon't have to use a push-up bra anymore!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.46,0:12:41.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I also used Mayura's two-layered craft technique\Nto recreate her "impossible" boot design!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.33,0:12:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everything okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.00,0:12:50.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah, like, listening to all these details made\Nme realize how wrong I was doing it before.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.50,0:12:53.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I kinda feel embarrassed I even called that cosplay.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.67,0:12:55.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't need to feel embarrassed!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.08,0:12:59.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,This isn't the "right" way to do it, Aria-chan.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.83,0:13:07.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just want you to see how fun it is to\Nrecreate a character you really love!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.21,0:13:09.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,So just make it about love...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.13,0:13:14.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right!\NWhat do you like so much about Ariel?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.67,0:13:15.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's easy!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.71,0:13:20.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love how she fights for her friends!\NMeria from VB is the same way!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.25,0:13:23.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love girls who care about friendship.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.67,0:13:28.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why I always want to make\Nnew friends and get to know them!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.71,0:13:32.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, so manga is why she turned into a gyaru?!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.00,0:13:33.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can that even happen?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.13,0:13:38.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Otaku, gyaru, and delinquents\Nmay all share a common ancestor...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.25,0:13:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's it, good!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.04,0:13:48.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now connect it up...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.25,0:13:50.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're doing great!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.92,0:13:52.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I dunno, really?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.92,0:13:52.29,Q5,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senpai! Are you listening? Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.29,0:13:54.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,The base for your top is finished!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.29,0:13:54.71,Q5,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senpai! Are you listening? Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.71,0:13:56.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's have you try it on
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.71,0:13:56.54,Q5,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senpai! Are you listening? Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.54,0:13:58.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,before we sew everything together.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.54,0:13:58.17,Q5,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senpai! Are you listening? Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.13,0:14:10.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm slowing things down!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.25,0:14:12.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to do anyway,\Nso I'll just head home!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.46,0:14:16.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way! Just chill here, god!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.04,0:14:16.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.71,0:14:19.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your presence gives us\Nso much more motivation!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.13,0:14:22.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what makes him so special?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.29,0:14:27.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you talking is hard for you, I can wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.71,0:14:29.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's a good person.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.13,0:14:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Together, we'll make it happen!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.38,0:14:36.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can kind of imagine what happened.\NI'm sure they've had their own moments.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.29,0:14:41.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's shown them he's trustworthy.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.25,0:14:44.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna sit outside and replay\NEpisode 13 in my head.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.96,0:14:47.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Him, though?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.17,0:14:57.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It fits like a glove!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.50,0:15:00.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm looking closer,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.42,0:15:02.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,and it even has the same folds\Nin the fabric we saw in the anime!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.21,0:15:05.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's hella accurate!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.83,0:15:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is anyone gonna notice that tiny detail, though?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.25,0:15:11.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Senpai?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.46,0:15:16.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you've got the same fabric folds, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.25,0:15:17.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, then!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.83,0:15:21.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I messed up again!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.67,0:15:25.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I keep messing up the stitches\Nand the pleats are all over the place.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.25,0:15:27.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,This sucks so bad!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.13,0:15:30.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, pleated skirts are really tough.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.96,0:15:34.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you can't redo stitches on stretch\NPVC so it's back to square one...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.88,0:15:37.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm trapped in stretch PVC hell!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.21,0:15:41.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so bad at this. I can't do it right.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.21,0:15:43.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm like, never gonna be as good as you.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.13,0:15:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.13,0:15:47.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just keep persevering,\Nand the pleats will eventually be done!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.54,0:15:49.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna persevere...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.21,0:15:53.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey Ririsa, how long do\NI have to keep this on for?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.88,0:15:55.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I totally forgot!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.88,0:16:00.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai left to catch that anime at 6,\Nso maybe I should head out, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.96,0:16:02.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.54,0:16:04.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wanna grab dinner at a restaurant together?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.46,0:16:06.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,My mom's gonna be home late.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.42,0:16:07.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That sounds great!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.42,0:16:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Want to come with, Mikari-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.75,0:16:09.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Want to come with, Mikari-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.75,0:16:09.29,Q9,,0,0,0,,Dinner together with friends?!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.29,0:16:10.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, I guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.29,0:16:10.88,Q9,,0,0,0,,Dinner together with friends?!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.88,0:16:13.13,Q9,,0,0,0,,I can check that off my Friend Wishlist!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.63,0:16:20.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love when there's a tablet so\NI don't have to talk to the waiter...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.38,0:16:22.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-what do you all want?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.92,0:16:24.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What're you getting, Nono-pi?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.79,0:16:26.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't normally eat that much.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.67,0:16:31.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Omu! Omurice!\NI can eat an entire plate of omurice by myself!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.17,0:16:34.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Omurice has saved my life time and time again!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.83,0:16:36.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What are you getting, Aria-chan?!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.71,0:16:40.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm still frustrated from earlier,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.00,0:16:42.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I'm getting tandoori\Nchicken with Mexican pilaf.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.79,0:16:44.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Make that extra pilaf.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.58,0:16:49.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's 1300 Calories... what does she eat in a day?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.42,0:16:53.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll have a chicken salad and an acai yogurt.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.54,0:16:55.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're on a model's diet!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.38,0:16:57.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,How about you, Ririsa-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.58,0:17:01.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I found a super-cheap combo I can order!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.25,0:17:02.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're all about cost!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.13,0:17:09.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Evening combo mixed grill with extra rice,\Na side of fries, salad and endless drink refills.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.33,0:17:14.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then extra sides of corn potage and bread rolls,\Nand a jumbo strawberry parfait for dessert!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.92,0:17:35.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,C-can I order some anmitsu?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.42,0:17:36.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,She went for it!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.21,0:17:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.67,0:17:42.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa-chan, you make cosroms, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.46,0:17:47.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,With all our prep for the group cosplay,\Nare you gonna be able to make a ROM for Comiket?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.83,0:17:50.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or did you not get a spot?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.33,0:17:52.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, actually...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.13,0:17:58.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,When I went to Winter Comiket,\NI didn't even grab an application for summer.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.29,0:18:00.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.92,0:18:08.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, back then...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.75,0:18:10.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I get your new Liliel doujin?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.42,0:18:16.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have even imagined I'd be here now...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.71,0:18:23.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Preparing to go to Summer Comiket\Nwith friends in a group cosplay!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.42,0:18:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa-chan was just like me...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.58,0:18:28.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,F-friends?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.92,0:18:32.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, I guess you could call us that.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.46,0:18:39.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right!\NWe're going to cosplay together, as friends!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.83,0:18:44.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Meria and Ariel fought hard for their friends!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.17,0:18:47.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't give up!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.54,0:18:50.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to become them,\Njust like Ririsa does!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.88,0:18:58.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to persevere for my friends!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.50,0:19:08.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's it, that's it!\NYou're doing perfect so far, Aria-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.79,0:19:13.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,So... You have to start over again?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.96,0:19:16.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Give her a little time to process it emotionally...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.25,0:19:24.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're almost there...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.17,0:19:27.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right.\NStop the needle...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.58,0:19:33.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm done! With just the skirt, but still!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.83,0:19:37.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria-chan, you did so good!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.63,0:19:41.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great job!\NYou've really been putting in effort!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.92,0:19:43.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I gotta try it on!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.13,0:19:45.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aria-chan, Okumura-senpai is-
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.96,0:19:50.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gone!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.58,0:19:52.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are rather slow.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.50,0:19:56.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,He left faster than the speed of sound...\NLike a true hero.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.83,0:20:42.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's perfect!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.88,0:20:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, where's mine?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.83,0:20:48.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! I've been working on it at home!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.54,0:20:51.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! When the hell do you sleep?!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.21,0:20:55.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gotta get that fabric...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.71,0:20:57.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.25,0:20:59.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nono-pi, how do I look?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.54,0:21:02.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really good! This part looks great!\NHow'd you manage it?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.75,0:21:04.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,A lot of sweat, blood, and tears!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.96,0:21:07.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, see you later, girls!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.83,0:21:11.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, we start putting on the finishing touches!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.33,0:21:56.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.67,0:22:01.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kisaki residence, who's calling?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.13,0:22:02.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's on the phone?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.33,0:22:03.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,My mother-in-law? Please.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.42,0:22:05.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dad's mom called?!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.38,0:22:10.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,We haven't been family for a long time.\NWhat do you want?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.21,0:22:14.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look, it doesn't matter...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.96,0:22:16.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,He died years ago.
